// One visual clock for the whole Moog surface family. Keep it independent from
// requestAnimationFrame: WKWebView can suspend rAF while a touch/slider tracking
// loop is active, which made playheads, LEDs and meters visibly freeze during edits.
// A bounded shared timer preserves the single-clock architecture without coupling
// runtime feedback to compositor frames.
const moogVisualSubscribers=new Set();let moogVisualTimer=0
